# ChessGateway client access keys (used when auth.enabled is true).
# One client per line: <name> <access-key>
# Generate a key with: uuidgen
# Names accept ASCII letters, digits, '.', '_' and '-' (1 to 64 characters).
# Empty lines and lines starting with # are ignored.
#
# Example:
# desktop-workstation f81d4fae-7dec-11d0-a765-00a0c91e6bf6
